  "question": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi></math> moles of a polyatomic gas<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo></math> must be mixed with two moles of a monoatomic gas so that the mixture behaves as a diatomic gas. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi></math> is:",
    "image": null
  },
